{
  "$comment": "chromekit theme palettes. Kit-owned (not the design-vault tokens file). Each theme overrides tokens.json colour keys; anything not listed comes from tokens.json. 'red' is the default and must override nothing, so it stays identical to tokens.json. In other themes the red.* keys are the primary accent (commands, frames, clock, bars) and cyan.* the secondary accent (selected, readouts, labels). 'accent' is the special purple accent, the only themed status-adjacent colour (defaults to the error magenta). The alert and status colours (error, warning, green, gold) are fixed: the generator refuses theme overrides. 'glass' holds the glass-variant defaults (glass is off unless the user turns it on); a theme may override any glass value.",
  "version": 1,
